   (`Master_Docking_AD_Full_Protein.ipynb` cell `24f6dd5d`), producing
   `per_pose_metrics.csv` and `oracle_summary.csv` in
   `benchmark_full_protein_vina_scoring/dock/pose_comparison_report/`. Required by
